## CI Detection Logic (how version-bump.yml works)

```
BREAKING CHANGE: anywhere in commit body  →  MAJOR bump
<type>!(<scope>):                          →  MAJOR bump  (bang syntax)
feat(<scope>):                             →  MINOR bump
fix(<scope>):                              →  PATCH bump
chore/docs/refactor/test/ci:              →  NO bump
```

The CI workflow (`unified-trading-pm/.github/workflows/version-bump.yml`) handles this automatically. **Never bump versions locally** — the CI owns the version number.

