## Quickmerge Commands Reference

```bash
# Major bump — breaking API change
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat!(unified-market-interface): remove legacy normalize_trade API"

# Major bump — breaking config change
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat!(unified-config-interface): rename GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT to GCP_PROJECT_ID"

# Major bump — breaking schema change (cloud-agnostic storage)
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat!(unified-domain-client): rename instrument_key column to instrument_id in output schema"

# Major bump — breaking message bus schema
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat!(unified-events-interface): rename UPLOAD_STARTED event to DATA_BROADCAST"

# Major bump with dep-branch isolation (when deps also have local changes)
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat!(unified-market-interface): remove legacy API" --dep-branch "feat/v2-adapters"

# Minor bump — new feature, backward compatible
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat(unified-market-interface): add CanonicalAdapter.normalize_ohlcv"

# Patch bump — bug fix, no API change
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "fix(unified-market-interface): handle zero-volume trades in normalize_trade"

# No bump — tooling or docs only
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "chore(unified-market-interface): update .gitignore"
bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "docs(unified-market-interface): update venue adapter examples"
```

